ethong won the second game.","ids":[63131],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"P.V. Sindhu said, \"Some matches you just have to find a way to win. Today was one of those\".","ids":[63036],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"She had to find a way to win and credited Supanida Katethong for the challenge, P.V. Sindhu said.","ids":[63123],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"P.V. Sindhu tweeted about her match performance.","ids":[63126],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"P.V. Sindhu expressed relief at winning despite not playing at her best.","ids":[63133],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"P.V. Sindhu won the first game 21-14, and won the third game 23-21.","ids":[63130,63132],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","performers","performers","performers","performers","say","say","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/badminton/pv-sindhu-survives-thai-scare-enters-french-open-quarterfinals-10391951.html","outlet":"News18","title":"PV Sindhu Survives Thai Scare, Enters French Open Quarterfinals","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/sindhu-survives-scare-to-advance-at-french-open/article71609001.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Sindhu survives scare to advance at French Open","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"who":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"PV Sindhu",null,null]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"P.V. Sindhu defeated Supanida Katethong in the French Open Super 750 badminton tournament.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"News18","url":"https://www.news18.com/sports/badminton/pv-sindhu-survives-thai-scare-enters-french-open-quarterfinals-10391951.html","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/sindhu-survives-scare-to-advance-at-french-open/article71609001.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"P.V. Sind